            "review_title": "Review at Đảo Xanh Quán",
            "review_text": "Merryheart\nSingapore, Singapore11100 contributions\n0\nSeafood feast\nDec 2023 • Family\nRecommended by the hotel, it was proven to be a great choice. The restaurant staff were very friendly & there was no touting which made us feel at ease. We were blown away with the live seafood cooked to perfection at very reasonable price. For 3 persons, we had a big lobster, 3 big mantis prawn, bamboo clam, sweet snails, prawn sashimi. It was really a seafood feast, and we were spoiled for choice. I must say most of the Vietnamese restaurants are good with oriental style stir fry but cheese baked dishes are less impressive as the cheese used are not of good quality. The staff here could speak English & Mandarin, very impressive. The total bill was about USD 85, this would cost us easily double back home.\nRead more\nWritten December 19, 2023",
